     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Actionable agreements",
     "texto": [
      "A follow-up note states who does what and by when. Write full dates when they could be confused and separate decisions from pending tasks. The passive is useful for general actions, but assign a responsible person to each task."
     ],
